{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0065", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_13", "topic_id": "AXIS_13_T04", "question_id": null, "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "豪州のLNGプロジェクトの権益を持つ三菱商事の持分法適用会社が1,927百万米ドルを限度に銀行と融資契約を結び、三菱商事は他の参画事業者とともに返済を保証している。三菱商事の最大保証額はFY2025末で538百万米ドル（前期690百万米ドル）。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0228", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0229", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0230", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": "AUDITED_FINANCIAL", "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "プロジェクト名・借入人名は有報に記載なし。", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0066", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_13", "topic_id": "AXIS_13_T06", "question_id": null, "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "三菱商事の金融保証残高には信用状付割引手形がFY2025末で56,817百万円（前期45,940百万円）含まれる。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0231", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": "AUDITED_FINANCIAL", "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0067", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_13", "topic_id": "AXIS_13_T03", "question_id": "Q-C02-A13-T03-02", "claim_type": "ANALYSIS", "statement": "三菱商事が開示したAethonの取得価額は5,200百万米ドルで、JBICの融資（JBIC分）は本体約1,560百万米ドルと米国法人約815百万米ドルの計約2,375百万米ドルなので、JBIC分は取得価額の約46%に当たる（いずれも米ドル建てで為替の仮定は不要）。民間金融機関（三菱UFJ銀行等）の協調融資分は開示されておらず、融資総額に占める政策金融の比率は分からない。取得価額は契約上の価額で、価格調整の有無は不明。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0114", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0001", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0002", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": null, "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "JBIC公表の融資金額はJBIC分（協調融資のうちJBIC担当分）。", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:19:49+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0121", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_13", "topic_id": "AXIS_13_T03", "question_id": null, "claim_type": "ANALYSIS", "statement": "Aethon買収の規模は資料によって表記が異なる。三菱商事の有報は『取得価額5,200百万米ドル』、売手側代理人のLatham & Watkinsは『US$7.5 billion sale』とする。差額約23億米ドルの内訳（負債の引継ぎ等）はどちらの資料にもなく、同じ尺度かは確認できない。JBIC分約2,375百万米ドルは前者の約46%、後者の約32%に当たり、政策金融の比率は分母の定義で大きく変わる。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0114", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0416", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_INDIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0001", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0002", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": null, "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "7.5 billionが企業価値（負債込み）である可能性は推定で、確認していない。", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:24:54+09:00"}
{"claim_id": "CLM-C02-0125", "company_id": "COMPANY_02", "axis_id": "AXIS_13", "topic_id": "AXIS_13_T01", "question_id": null, "claim_type": "FACT", "statement": "千代田化工建設は2026年6月30日、三菱UFJ銀行と借入限度額200億円（2年、無担保、変動金利）のコミットメントライン契約を結び、同行からの劣後借入200億円を期限前返済し、三菱商事の完全子会社である三菱商事フィナンシャルサービスとの融資契約（借入限度額100億円）を解約した。グループ内の資金供与から銀行との直接取引への切り替えにあたる。", "evidence": [{"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0427", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0428", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0429", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0430", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0431", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}, {"passage_id": "PSG-C02-0432", "direction": "SUPPORT", "relation": "PRIMARY_DIRECT"}], "valid_from": null, "valid_to": null, "validity": "HISTORICAL_IMMUTABLE", "info_class": null, "snapshot": "asof_2026-11-01", "notes": "『グループ内の資金供与から銀行との直接取引への切り替え』は分析的な要約。", "recorded_at": "2026-11-10T21:24:54+09:00"}
